Only xet_client, xet_core_structures, and xet_runtime are vendored. The local
xet_client changes opt authenticated reconstruction requests into the existing
bounded retry policy for intermittent 401 responses, and preserve partial bytes
after a truncated single-range response so only the missing suffix is resumed
from the same signed Xet URL. Other 401 responses remain fatal.
